Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's pick what we're having for breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:12.74,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:22.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't listen at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:28.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... If it's a cold, you'll need water, a sports drink and dairy products.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:32.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything that's easy to digest...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to get something for yourself for breakfast, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like cereal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:40.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:46.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did I spread it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:55.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Cold Germs are all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It could be caught by spreading, or it could develop on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:03.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to worry about who spreads it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:07.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I also choose a get-well gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.61,0:01:08.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:15.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,These.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:20.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put them inside the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:26.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.74,0:01:29.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you in the snack aisle!?{What are you doing in the snack aisle?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! Breakfast is{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:39.03,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I pulled it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:21.30,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My house is over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:30.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's better if we go home, otherwise we'll disturb her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:31.80,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The breakfast for tomorrow is inside. Give it to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:37.69,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's really heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, let's go back home, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:45.25,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Daikichi bought us things to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you hear what I said!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:50.04,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.33,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:59.71,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry to have you always looking out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:03.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, I should apologise instead. \NYou're always looking after Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.09,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,How is Rin-chan doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:07.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's completely recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She started going to school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:11.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.30,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.04,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it great, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:19.02,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making some of that porridge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.86,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get better after eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:27.14,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Toss the tooth with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:29.29,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:34.64,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:35.94,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani-san, you could have caught it from when you were looking after Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:45.25,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to toss it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.64,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I see lots of people every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:46.64,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.72,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I also take a fully packed train to work, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.72,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to throw it onto the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.27,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You never know who you got it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:54.52,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't have to worry,{\alpha&FFFFFF&} it's only a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.52,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't have to worry, it's only a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:04:59.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:03.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, in the very least, please let me help with Kouki-kun.{Well, the least I could do is help with Kouki-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine even if it's just getting him from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:09.78,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:13.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:20.95,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Let's play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.80,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. We'll play next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:27.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, be sure to help out your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.22,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:37.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:42.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding and that small bottle of drink are from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:46.32,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:49.46,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I love eating puddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:08.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's so early. It's Sunday today, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:12.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You promised we'll practise for the skipping competition together. {Nawatobi 縄跳び = Skipping}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:24.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's also starting to move. {Can we make the subs like the way she speaks? It's distorted due to her hand being in her mouth. Please consider. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Brush it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:36.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.35,0:06:43.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:46.23,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm already well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:49.05,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry to always have to rely on you for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:53.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Us too. Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:54.73,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's quite unexpected, coming from Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:07:00.02,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,He's not good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:04.77,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:11.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When the rope turns one round, you jump at this point, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It won't work if your hands and legs are not working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:15.74,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The hands first, then comes the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:19.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Slow down your hands and jump to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:20.62,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:23.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Teach me too! Teach me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, your arms are too far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Close your arms like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:31.05,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san~!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.24,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,You sure are early!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.97,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Good mooorning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:37.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They are way too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:44.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu-kun is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:47.94,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,He has a brother, so he learns everything from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you not skipping, Sayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:59.07,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,Her front teeth have fallen off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:04.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The girls have it tough even when they are so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.95,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:10.82,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,What does your tooth container look like?{歯の入れ物}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:12.38,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get a cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:17.31,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,It's a case to store teeth inside for commemoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:18.51,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:18.51,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Commemoration?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:22.45,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,There's a type that's small and round. They're really cute looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:20.66,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Very small?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.45,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Very cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:24.90,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, mine is the shape of a butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:29.19,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Seems like something that Rin will really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:30.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm too careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.89,0:08:33.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think there would be such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.05,0:08:37.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm always like this ever since meeting Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:41.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Getting paranoid and anxious over the littlest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:45.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is for you, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:46.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I drew this in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:50.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's to introduce a family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:53.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:58.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:02.04,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You use this to contain your fallen off teeth. It's a form of memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! Kouki-kun's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:07.81,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But what about Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:13.03,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.85,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to throw them forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:15.78,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,...That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I threw those before onto the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.76,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will that be OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can toss them onto the roof and also keep them as memory. Isn't that pretty good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:25.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:39.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll also do my best to skip this time round.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:46.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Touching your tooth again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll come off even if you don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:52.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how you look at it, it seems like she's been punched in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She won't be able to smile for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:57.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK, it's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hurry and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:06.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown taller again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.21,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,What? You're joining in too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:12.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I seem to have gotten fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.92,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.54,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pain{ in the ass} once we reach this age. {Sorry, no "ass", "s***", "f***" in our subs :) Please use alternate phrasing if needed. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:18.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hope to control it, regardless of which.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.25,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Daikichi-san's doing the boxer jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.77,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:29.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The pressure on the knees are smaller if you skip like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:31.27,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:34.73,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Teach me that move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:39.20,Default-Alt,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not showing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.20,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's that? You're the only one acting cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:42.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect your normal skipping before you ask me to teach you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.33,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:47.87,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:49.63,Default,Nobu,0000,0000,0000,,I want to learn too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:01.12,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, your backward skipping is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.34,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kids are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:02.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.06,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kids are always energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:09.52,Default-Alt,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:09.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where do they get all the stamina from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:19.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, but adults are amazing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:21.29,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Both of you should also have heard about it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:26.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not Rin's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:30.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I only started living with Rin about one year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:34.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Before that, I used to spend all the time I have on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:38.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My life started changing after I started living with Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:42.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But all of you have already been with your kids for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:48.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel anything, since I've been at it for only a short period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:55.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't know if I'll be able to bear with not having time for myself from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:12:00.36,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Hm? I don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.74,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:02.61,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,Me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:05.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:07.23,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Because... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:13.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? What do you mean?! {He sounds like a 60-year-old lolol -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:19.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, wasn't the skipping tournament today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:20.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:21.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:24.76,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How many jumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,15 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about the backward skip?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:40.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,203 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:43.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What! You can skip that many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:45.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be, you got first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:48.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, this is the certificate. {shoujou 賞状 = honourable certificate}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:52.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really worked hard. Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:55.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But I should be able to do more of the forward skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:58.61,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you only get to decide the winner once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:04.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you were able to jump so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:06.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:12.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I lost weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:16.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It'll probably take ten more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:25.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You've got to show them your front teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:27.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:30.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I already told you, don't keep touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:32.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm also going to show them how I can skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:36.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You've grown rather tall recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:39.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}My mom and dad will surely be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:43.89,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Aunty might even say "You're even taller than me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:46.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it'll be so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:54.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We should also tell Grandpa about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:57.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1880)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:02.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:05.62,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin-chan! I've waited so long for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:06.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:09.73,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh look look, you've really grown taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:11.81,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Are you taller then your classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:16.03,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I would have drove to pick you two up if only you called earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:17.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's only a ten minute walk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is able to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:22.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'll become taller than me very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:32.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you're here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.52,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.02,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That shirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:40.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You used to wear it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:41.36,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:43.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Aunty gave it to me a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:45.72,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, {\alpha&FFFFFF&}let me look at your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:46.91,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, let me look at your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.07,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:54.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Now my two front teeth are starting to shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.89,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Are you all right? Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:59.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm fine. Sometimes it hurts,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:00.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}but I'm already used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:01.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm a pro. {Professional}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.20,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:06.76,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Can't you think of something! It's turned red!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It's only slightly red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:12.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Speaking of which, didn't you ask me to tie a string and put it off when I was young?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:12.32,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,String?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:15.06,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh my, something like that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:18.27,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'll try to make softer food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:19.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want some Koyadofu? {Koyadofu 高野豆腐 = Frozen dried tofu cubes http://japanesefood.about.com/od/miscingredients/p/Koyadofu.htm}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.07,Note,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Koyadofu 高野豆腐 = Frozen dried tofu cubes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:26.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Aunty, I can also eat simmered beans.{Nimame 煮豆 = Cooked/baked beans, in this case black cooked beans}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.06,Default,Aunty,0000,0000,0000,,Yes yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:32.82,Default,Aunty,0000,0000,0000,,Eat more of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:40.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I love Koyadofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:49.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It came off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:50.88,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It dropped off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Woah! Blood! Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:00.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Tissues! tissues!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:01.81,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:03.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, use this to hold it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:06.77,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1880)}That's a rag!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:12.15,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan has changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:14.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:17.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe this is the real Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:21.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you're getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:23.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom told me about it just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.29,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:27.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great. I heard he's a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:29.30,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,He's OK, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:34.52,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,But that kind of person is the type that wants to have kids right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Now isn't that even better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:37.51,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you kidding!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:39.68,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,How do I go drinking? How do I go see live concerts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.48,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Going on trips too, and eating good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.36,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I would end up not being able to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to your future husband about things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:49.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{It's not possible for me to understand.}It won't change anything even if you talk to me. {The one in brackets is the literal TL, please use whichever fits better. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:52.14,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I am not good with children.{Besides, I don't even like children. }
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:55.36,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I also don't want to turn into one of those thick-skinned old hags.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.83,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the confidence to sacrifice myself into looking after children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:06.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I think there'll always be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you're willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll go well then even if you don't want it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:13.71,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You really love getting in other people's business, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:15.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:17.05,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:21.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never experienced being a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:25.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've also never experienced being a father or a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:30.14,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:38.37,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that I no longer have time to go shopping or have tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:42.33,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,But the time when I work is my own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:51.70,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,The time spent together with your child is also your own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:52.84,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,They're precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:57.84,Default,Miichan,0000,0000,0000,,I may be a parent myself, but I don't think I'm at all that different from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:02.76,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, everyone around us has become a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:10.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My permanent teeth are already growing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:16.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:23.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:26.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:33.06,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Get ready!{Here we go! }{ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:45.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That flower vase...{ep8}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san also had it.{ep8}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be back very soon. {ep8}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:16.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:19.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What! Another one came off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:22.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mirror, mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps, from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:26.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll also get paranoid and anxious over the tiniest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:32.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,500)}But these people are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:36.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:38.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.60,0:20:43.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look! Look! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:49.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is this? Your face looks just like a kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.07,0:20:50.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:52.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's mail it back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:54.14,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Send a photo of it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:55.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:57.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:00.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It is what truly brings me joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.87,0:21:03.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:03.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah~!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:12.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think this isn't too bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:57.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1000)}Daikichi~!
